#: scenario5:scenario5_C685EEA4_AC83_46D8_8B2A_9813F2571154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a5c03545faf88e565c2cfb95c6d0b1bb9492e7b1d9a99238abace5fb3a60ede
#. default-sha256: 99f65ecf55e025ef0b85eeeba1ec9275a41dc9743979b8c3d648709ebcc0afe5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C685EEA4_AC83_46D8_8B2A_9813F2571154"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I haven’t made any requests recently, but you can write what you want on a sheet of parchment"
"—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or, if we don’t have any, something similar—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫put it in the box, and leave it "
"outside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ho fatto alcuna richiesta recentemente, ma puoi scrivere quello che desideri su un "
"foglio di pergamena—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o se non ne abbiamo,⟪k:3⟫usa qualcosa di simile—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫mettilo "
"nel baule, e lascialo fuori."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1E93294_06F9_4B17_A090_3C9FD122604A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
