msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1E93294_06F9_4B17_A090_3C9FD122604A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as your request is not completely unreasonable,⟪k:1⟫it should arrive with the next "
"package.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why, is there something you need?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Finché non chiedi nulla di irragionevole,⟪k:1⟫dovrebbe arrivare con la prossima consegna."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perché, c’è qualcosa che ti serve?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DA7B9844_485E_4F03_85FC_0841A86EE882
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4003dcc1a8d138309341486ae14025f58a1adf66fb60aedbfe60849ef86bc36
