msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yeah, I was hoping to increase our selection of vegetables!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And while I’m at "
"it, if possible..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Già, speravo di aumentare l’assortimento di verdura!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E già che ci sono, se "
"possibile..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B68B0FD0_B3AD_4D48_86F5_59EA81E69C88
