"gradually transitioned from master and servant to something closer to friends."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Il nostro rapporto padrone-"
"domestica divenne gradualmente qualcosa di più vicino all’amicizia."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C80E822B_FA8A_4411_821A_E295F40BFF1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d420c01a540bb55fc0ef41367382cfea99404b9417ebbf60a6fb3619771fa758
