msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A87FD8DF_8DC5_4511_92C2_070132823A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though he was still not very talkative and oftentimes hard to read,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nonostante fosse ancora riservato e difficile da capire,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 021d78ec4712fc9668c07732fa14c9d3d1fd9b6583ae106b53f4b92f3ceefa06
#. default-sha256: 48ce2410b196e4564bc92a48776be959d9bdf719ea9f2a2c81990438caa8213b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫he at least seemed to be making an effort to close the gap."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫quantomeno sembrava impegnarsi nel ridurre la distanza tra noi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0831a7f572f035ac4082d844feeb6e4e38e81b4a0a48dbdc771857a55accf24c
#. default-sha256: fe47a473e486a04078baa34e57bcf4a260db247e64a6e0838bfa51c18dd16c6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would, on occasion, tell me about himself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not in much detail, and "
"anytime his family came up, he grimaced uncomfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A volte, mi raccontava di se stesso—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫seppur senza scendere nei dettagli—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e "
"ogni volta che la sua famiglia saltava fuori, provava disagio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45c1a966891bfea64400d63bde9bb1660d9c85ddffdd4f57aebc144f674c3f5b
#. default-sha256: e1a716e29e9d82dd2014ae6d518abda17f54113218b3bae28243ebbca3226218
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, his father had wanted him dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sembrava che suo padre lo volesse morto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd439a62dffd228897c996dcd539f5bcf8f78d08a497712420dd85c665ec851f
#. default-sha256: 548936e6974bf7d73332589fe1783fcfd870cdf25f00bb5218c50de6b6c7bdd0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His brothers, though, had worked to create a scenario in which he could live, faking his "
"death and sending him to this remote mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, i suoi fratelli misero su una farsa che gli permettesse di continuare a vivere, "
"fingendo la sua morte e nascondendolo alla villa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35357c0e36636d3b12f51bba1cdb45dc590ffda3564a0b3e47178f3ebb2a045a
#. default-sha256: b7af04480a40b5ec4cd43d1d3e8c2cfc21b5f052a7b9e92344ca813f6b7fff49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never encountered Michel’s brothers while at his family’s estate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo mai incontrato i fratelli di Michel quando lavoravo alla tenuta della sua famiglia."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8acb9094a95df6a046271e84689db5fb3edb556ebfabf44a766b6f16eab3770
#. default-sha256: 15a600c0867e8ea17353654c4e540a29f859483dd7e80b0952f9c0a2b241f3db
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But assuming he was right and it was one of them who had given me that letter, they were "
"likely our only allies at that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma supponendo che avesse ragione, e che fosse stato uno di loro⟪k:1⟫ad avermi dato quella "
"lettera, probabilmente erano i nostri unici alleati in quella casa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cf591f5c92d01c89d1b8081e873195c0f6e751d2fe60f5f022054d00d0ebde1
#. default-sha256: 967efacf5039c0ee45c51e9415990933d5cc762dc1f0eb420fb563626eecf4b7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t know what he’s thinking. It’s been ten years,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel had muttered, ⟪k:3⟫"
"to which I had replied, ⟪k:4⟫“Have faith.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Non so cosa stia pensando mio fratello a quest’ora.⟪k:1⟫Sono passato dieci anni...”,⟪k:2⟫ "
"mormorò Michel,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫al che io risposi, ⟪k:5⟫“Abbi fiducia”."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 790a7d15ad47d7e3386b3d75cdaa432b5232659beeaa0ccf3681deda3943aef6
#. default-sha256: f65eed89e61832b5216e89b594c19ce8b41d99ba1a67bd785e6f570c802358ba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was better to believe in ⟪k:1⟫something⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫even if it felt silly and unreasonable,"
"⟪k:4⟫than to lose faith in everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era meglio credere in ⟪k:1⟫qualcosa⟪k:2⟫, per quanto potesse sembrare sciocco e "
"irragionevole, piuttosto che perdere fiducia in ogni cosa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84377b2df272024da88a7dda6eae3f0e54b23e02bbb7b282439055ee48600c47
#. default-sha256: 95c5a93c21103f5cbd844d0c84502875502f87bdfabd87c205e9ed35b2e9e72d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My being able to find renewed belief in the kindness of people...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫was what had "
"allowed me to start smiling again, after all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mia capacità di trovare una rinnovata speranza nella gentilezza della gente...⟪k:1⟫ è ciò "
"che mi aveva permesso di ricominciare a sorridere, dopotutto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c592fa98c1ab193875d5d412c5d8468c3dce924d173f582181742412981b4ef
#. default-sha256: 37cd905342d26d86ca64cf403242d7fd0c54e58a0266b747af9faddca0b56f03
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I was able to have that faith, I was able to enjoy life once more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E proprio grazie a quella speranza, ero in grado di godermi la vita ancora una volta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfe9418443f8d3c499935ae3d134c6ef515e8e399b5a0b2eb283463cd815d429
#. default-sha256: e04e3b41e90b2d60f65bad4019a1ed4aeb6ef444c1bfea69e8b0cf026b81c900
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t an exciting or thrilling life; ⟪k:1⟫it was a humble, simple one with just the two "
"of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La nostra non era una vita eccitante o emozionante;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫era semplice e modesta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_84D5B7A5_D528_4F22_A744_3B58EC9C6ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e568a71e53646b98895d2b2f75e5fb9d663f665076864403abb0150d5aaeab75
#. default-sha256: 15b9a203503f953b1cf45f42f9be2d1b9538e42bd2fbf1ba0f81654258fcd755
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_84D5B7A5_D528_4F22_A744_3B58EC9C6ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I wouldn’t trade that light for anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non l’avrei scambiata per nessun’altra cosa al mondo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1CFD07EA_A58A_4A44_993F_45497DCEADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10404c97954321e23d199dfd2b3b05f9dd5c96c00eea692f61242bed77a18055
#. default-sha256: 70a7a5e224c0965d0402bb40d3507dfe78452d5913673f865de54eef8b54cd82
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1CFD07EA_A58A_4A44_993F_45497DCEADC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Some people might think it dull or dreary, but it was ⟪k:1⟫ours⟪k:2⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qualcuno avrebbe potuto pensare che fosse triste e noiosa,⟪k:1⟫ma era la ⟪k:2⟫nostra⟪k:3⟫."

#: scenario5:scenario5_277A3155_8D53_4201_BB00_68B1C0E14DCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b686202533abdc04c2cb26bad204272c0dc53d183159d36d1b072acbaa2dbd2
#. default-sha256: f4a56268210e80596d03b8070ebe405e199c93f7687e61072d22643fa61eda6b
