"⟪k:0⟫Dieci anni... ⟪k:1⟫Avevo vissuto da solo per dieci anni.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La solitudine era stata la "
"mia normalità,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E8C2B19_5343_4ECB_BD87_4DBFB03E941B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c97a06093cb1949b01a227a012ed4417e034edd291b1857741dd04f1e5ff719b
#. default-sha256: 48128723763ef7ba24287a4ce29623e62ff793cbd7987d46290ea52180c9e713
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E8C2B19_5343_4ECB_BD87_4DBFB03E941B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but that was very rapidly changing at her hands."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma grazie a lei le cose stavano cambiando velocemente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB658B29_049B_4803_AC45_F3AB72BB4AED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92dd9a6e44d18206e8ba1c17de5326263181af7df77155d5ec0860143666ba17
#. default-sha256: fc5216eb881daac6e0419ba8127e7a169383b5c51ce8afa47828e751c2dc832b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB658B29_049B_4803_AC45_F3AB72BB4AED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were continually getting closer, yes, but not in a romantic sense."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Continuavamo ad avvicinarci, certo, ma non in senso romantico."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B93F8ECB_4FBE_4DE7_A74F_0AE23F60E4C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c7426bf8d1f4b7a856d783c05798c6ea80118ef21bb38dde2a6e9431a73486e
#. default-sha256: 99ee5febb7c5ad1195506a24b8eb56e735403ac4df6db9446113e9576b6b2104
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B93F8ECB_4FBE_4DE7_A74F_0AE23F60E4C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had to describe it, I would say “good friends” was probably the most apt. ⟪k:1⟫Time "
"continued to press on, our relationship remaining relatively stable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se avessi dovuto descrivere il nostro rapporto, probabilmente avrei detto che eravamo “buoni "
"amici”.⟪k:1⟫ Il tempo passava, ma le cose tra noi rimanevano inalterate."

#: scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c90a38ee7001bbb91088b4ff90c3836d41bebf7f6e269581673dff6b35636b9d
#. default-sha256: 340f3cfaed03617693a641db68b20dbc2c12c36e8e6c51a8e1f92f5710816ee4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, summer came, bringing with it the longest periods of sunlight I had experienced "
"in many years. ⟪k:1⟫Then, the leaves began falling from the trees, and before long, the world "
"grew cold and dreary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ben presto arrivò l’estate, portando con sé i più longevi periodi di sole che avessi mai "
"vissuto in tanti anni.⟪k:1⟫ E poi, le foglie cominciarono a cadere dagli alberi, e in breve "
"tempo, il mondo si fece freddo e uggioso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc151368f0f0cd629d8acecaee7a3de3f3d4d506a26577fcc246871485c10391
#. default-sha256: c002761bdebc8a21767a280a635d185d26061ea67f3d312f3a7366424542682c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That winter, the fireplace was never without a crackling blaze in its belly. ⟪k:1⟫The boiled "
"wine we drank was undoubtedly middling and cheap,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Durante quell’inverno, il caminetto non rimase mai privo del fuoco scoppiettante. ⟪k:1⟫Il "
"vino cotto che bevevamo era senza dubbio mediocre⟪k:2⟫e scadente,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9a6c429c4ff4dbd547e916376e68e76b8987f72a092e24577509c188124bb6b
#. default-sha256: 2cfdf89a1529fc8bd66ca1a36786edf8eb388978f2956d156d9c64c2916b744c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but she said, with a smile, ⟪k:1⟫“I’ve never had wine this good before.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And though "
"I didn’t say anything, I felt the same way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫eppure, una volta lei disse, ⟪k:1⟫“Non ho mai bevuto un vino così buono”,⟪k:2⟫ col sorriso "
"sulle labbra.⟪k:3⟫ E sebbene non avessi detto niente, pensavo la stessa cosa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F41DBBF2_2AA4_4DC4_9DD7_D9310B3D9D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95bbde2b93d91d97820feda7253a44428f1dc929665684cd34dca1a707f1c7e5
#. default-sha256: f83f20b1b17eb81d2ead45d4d1389f36e6b2c4e003ea7c0a44070040a8715814
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F41DBBF2_2AA4_4DC4_9DD7_D9310B3D9D50"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun set much earlier, and having stopped using candles, we found ourselves habitually "
"gathering around the fireplace when it grew dark."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il sole tramontava molto prima, e avendo smesso di usare le candele,⟪k:1⟫ci ritrovavamo "
"abitualmente attorno al caminetto quando faceva buio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E86A0C07_5355_4383_B9EF_8545CF914C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 553fcc11861f7a2083c1103f50448e4c1ba7c9f5ecf0d005db01013bf8bec224
#. default-sha256: c6976861f7b943b05a37f59f4bed9a7184c9f443cec3294ece0682f62854b724
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E86A0C07_5355_4383_B9EF_8545CF914C5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Reading a story by the fireplace like this almost "
"makes it feel like we’re in another world, doesn’t it, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Leggere una storia accanto al focolare mi fa sentire "
"come se venissimo trasportati in un altro mondo. Non lo pensi anche tu, Padrone?"

